# AI Classroom Monitoring - Simplified Mobile Design
## Based on Teacher Feedback & Last Year's Reference

**Design Constraints:**
- ✅ Mobile-first (fit standard phone viewport: 375×667 to 414×896)
- ✅ Maximum 2-3 swipes per screen
- ✅ Simple, clean layouts - avoid complexity
- ✅ Cover all 11 FYP committee requirements
- ✅ 10 core screens (reduced from 18)

---

## 🎯 Screen Breakdown by Role

### **SHARED SCREENS (All Roles)**

---

### **Screen 1: Login**
**Height: 1 viewport (no scroll)**

```
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   [Logo/App Icon]       │
│                         │
│  AI Classroom Monitor   │
│                         │
│ ┌─────────────────────┐ │
│ │ Email/ID            │ │
│ └─────────────────────┘ │
│                         │
│ ┌─────────────────────┐ │
│ │ Password  [👁]      │ │
│ └─────────────────────┘ │
│                         │
│    [Forgot Password?]   │
│                         │
│ ┌─────────────────────┐ │
│ │    LOGIN BUTTON     │ │
│ └─────────────────────┘ │
│                         │
└─────────────────────────┘
```

**Elements:**
- Logo/icon at top
- 2 input fields (email, password)
- Forgot password link
- Login button
- Role is auto-detected (no manual selection)

**Why simple:** Single purpose, minimal fields, no role confusion.

