```

**Sub-screens (accessed from here):**
- User Management → Add/Edit forms (simple forms, one at a time)
- Timetable Upload → File picker + validation
- Analytics → Simple charts (bar/line, not complex dashboards)
- Dispute Final Review → Similar to teacher dispute screen

**Why simple:** Grouped actions, no overwhelming data on one screen.

**Covers Requirement #9:** Attendance Threshold (admin views shortage reports in analytics)

